[h1]巨型水箱 / Mega Water Tank[/h1]
[b]v0.15.0[/b]

[b]真正能装水的巨型储水罐。[/b] 0.1 吨起步，主池/内胆最高 2.0 吨；主格 4×6 = 24 槽，满配 50 吨；右侧 4 个过滤器槽。水培、净水、扫描都按原版规则识别。

[hr][/hr]

[h2]特点[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]容量[/b]：主池/内胆 100 → 2000 L；4×6 = 24 槽，满配 50.0 吨。
[*][b]真实的水[/b]：原版成分/纯度/污染/温度，水培/净水/扫描可识别。
[*][b]溢出/回补[/b]：主池满后流入空内胆；低于 90% 自动回补。
[*][b]水库模式[/b]：全局目标 0–100%（默认 90%），±5% 死区，自动存/补内胆。
[*][b]机器预腾[/b]：湿气农场槽内按夜产预留（0–50 L），生产后回填。
[*][b]4 个过滤槽[/b]：2×2，普通/高级滤芯，左上优先，耗尽自动切换；只过滤主池进水。
[*][b]水色[/b]：随水质变化（同原版水瓶）。
[*][b]电话下单[/b]：「核桃水商 #21474836#」→ 储水。
[*][b]三语[/b]：简中/英/俄。
[/list]

[h2]怎么拿到[/h2]
[list]
[*]巨型水箱：500，送主池 + 1 内胆（200 L 起）。
[*]追加内胆：250，1 内胆（100 L 起）。
[*]扩容：150，所有容器 +100 L，可买 19 次（100 → 2000 L），无冷却。
[/list]
后仓发货；水箱/内胆每日一次，扩容可连买。

[h2]怎么用[/h2]
[list]
[*]灌水：和原版容器一样倒水。
[*]溢出：主池满后流入内胆，瓶子/水罐倒水也支持。
[*]回补：主池低于 90% 自动从内胆补。
[*]机器预腾：湿气农场槽内按夜产自动预留（常态 850 ml 约 1.35 L），生产后回填。
[*]水库模式：目标 0–100%（默认 90%）；高于 +5% 存内胆，低于 -5% 回补；此时 90% 回补/机器预腾停用。
[*]过滤器：4 个滤芯，左上优先；只过滤主池进水。
[*]查看/存放：原版 tooltip + 合计/内胆行；可放入任何装得下的容器。
[/list]

[h2]0.15.0 更新[/h2]
[list]
[*]4×6 主格：24 内胆槽，满配 50,000 L；旧 4×4 内胆坐标不变。
[*]过滤器槽：2×2，高级背景，4 滤芯左上优先自动切换。
[*]水库模式：全局目标，默认 90%，0–100%，±5%，25 L/次。
[*]倒水溢出：瓶子/机器临时瓶余量进内胆。
[*]日志降噪：汇总/区分/节流。
[/list]

[h2]已知限制[/h2]
[list]
[*]净水机单次量小，大水箱难净化，建议先净化小瓶。
[*]内胆成堆会被水库/溢出跳过，请拆单件。
[*]目标 0% 会清空主池；100% 不给机器留空间；90% 在 100 L 水箱极端产量可能不够，推荐 40–80%。
[*]过滤器只净化主池进水，水库搬水不净化旧脏水。
[*]满水主池不要丢垃圾桶（内胆一起消失）；不能卖给顾客。
[/list]

[h2]兼容性[/h2]
与 Item Details、Item Stacking、Container Manager、Water Machine Fix 同装测试通过。
装满液体的容器在堆叠时冻结（同原版规则）。

[hr][/hr]

[h1]English[/h1]
[b]v0.15.0[/b]

[h2]What it is[/h2]
A huge water tank that [b]starts at 0.1 t (100 L)[/b], with the main tank and each cell up to 2.0 t. Main grid 4×6 = 24 cells; 50 t fully loaded. Four filter slots on the right. Hydroponics, purifiers and the scanner read it through vanilla rules.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Capacity[/b]: 100 → 2000 L per tank/cell; 4×6 = 24 slots, 50.0 t fully loaded.
[*][b]Real water[/b]: vanilla composition, purity, contamination and temperature rules.
[*][b]Overflow/refill[/b]: extra water flows into empty cells; below 90% the tank pulls water back.
[*][b]Reservoir mode[/b]: global 0–100% target (default 90%), ±5% dead band, auto move to/from cells.
[*][b]Machine reserve[/b]: reserves nightly output in a Moisture Farm slot (0–50 L), refills after production.
[*][b]Four filters[/b]: 2×2, normal/advanced, top-left first, auto-switch; main-tank inflow only.
[*][b]Water tint[/b]: follows liquid quality (same as vanilla bottles).
[*][b]Phone order[/b]: 「Hetao Water Co. #21474836#」→ Water tab.
[*][b]Languages[/b]: Chinese, English, Russian.
[/list]

[h2]How to get one[/h2]
[list]
[*]Mega Water Tank: 500 — tank + 1 cell (200 L to start).
[*]Extra Tank Cell: 250 — 1 cell (100 L to start).
[*]Expand Capacity: 150 — all containers +100 L, 19 times (100 → 2000 L), no cooldown.
[/list]
Delivered to the back room. Tanks/cells once a day; expansion can be bought back to back.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]Fill: use the tank on a faucet, bottle or another container.
[*]Overflow: after full, extra water flows into cells; bottle/jug pours supported.
[*]Refill: below 90%, water is pulled back from cells.
[*]Machine reserve: in a Moisture Farm slot, reserves nightly output (about 1.35 L for 850 ml), refills after production.
[*]Reservoir mode: target 0–100% (default 90%); above +5% goes to cells, below -5% refills; the 90% refill and machine reserve are disabled.
[*]Filters: four cartridges, top-left first; main-tank inflow only.
[*]Inspect/storage: vanilla tooltip + Total/Cells lines; fits any container the vanilla tank fits.
[/list]

[h2]0.15.0 highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*]4×6 main grid: 24 cells, 50,000 L; old 4×4 cells keep coordinates.
[*]Filter slots: 2×2, advanced background, four cartridges, top-left first.
[*]Reservoir mode: global target, default 90%, 0–100%, ±5%, 25 L per move.
[*]Pour overflow: bottle/machine-jug remainder goes into cells.
[*]Log cleanup: summarized/classified/throttled.
[/list]

[h2]Known limitations[/h2]
[list]
[*]Vanilla purifiers process little at a time; purify small bottles first.
[*]Stacked cells are skipped by reservoir/overflow; split them.
[*]Target 0% empties the main tank; 100% leaves no machine room; 90% may not fit extreme output in a 100 L tank; 40–80% recommended.
[*]Filters only clean main-tank inflow; reservoir moves do not purify old dirty water.
[*]Do not trash a full tank (cells go with it); cannot be sold to customers.
[/list]

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
Tested with Item Details, Item Stacking, Container Manager and Water Machine Fix.
Filled containers freeze while stacked (vanilla rule).

